        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-02-04T13:40:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Boy, they really pile the damage on with this one. Advanced Dawn gives the villain targets extra damage. Chrono-Ranger can get his damage booster out right quick. And then Obsidian Field shows up and I start thinking that maybe Driving Mantis wasn't the most useful play. :B But I through first try, only losing Expat, and that's probably thanks to nemesis damage.</p>",
