        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/quirkydm/{size}/2033_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-02-07T12:56:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Near Mint. I thought the first game might have Dawn flip early, so I didn't take out the Return to Dawns as fast as I should have before realizing that was not going to be the problem. Still almost beat her, but got just barely outdamaged on the last turn.</p>\n<p>It really is just pile on the pain in this game. Everyone chips in on this one and all the damage boosts add up fast.</p>",
